# RadVeil extension for 3D Slicer (radveil-slicer)

Copyright 2026 Piotr Gródek and the radveil-slicer contributors

Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

This extension does not contain RadVeil itself. On first use it installs the
separately distributed `radveil` Python package (Apache-2.0) from PyPI or from
a wheel file the user provides. That package ships its own LICENSE, NOTICE and
THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt, covering the MediaPipe BlazeFace and Face Mesh model
weights (Copyright Google LLC, Apache-2.0) and the SynthStrip model weights
(Hoopes et al., MIT). If you publish results that use the brain segment,
please cite Hoopes et al., NeuroImage 260 (2022) 119474.

The images in docs/images are renders of 3D Slicer's public "MRHead" sample,
which its donor gave to the 3D Slicer project to be used without
restrictions. This repository contains no other imaging data; tests use
synthetic phantoms.

Names of third-party projects (3D Slicer, MediaPipe, SynthStrip, dlib) are used
only to identify the software and data this extension works with and do not
imply endorsement by their owners.
